## Printed
heading: FUN'S CROSS-WORD PUZZLES
banner: Can You Solve Them?
number: No 6
intro: Here is No. 6 in FUN'S series of cross-word puzzles. The solution to No. 5 will be found on page 15 of this issue. To solve today's puzzle fill in the small squares in the above diamond with words corresponding to the clues and definitions given below. The solution to today's cross-word puzzle will appear in next week's FUN.
solution-caption: And here is the solution to FUN'S cross-word puzzle No. 6 showing how the letters can be arranged to form words that fit the list of definitions given.
solution-centre: SOLUTION TO No 6 PUZZLE


